# Review & Merge Stage

**Verify, rebase, merge.**

## Pre-Merge Checklist
- [ ] All tests pass: go test ./...
- [ ] Backtests pass: ./scripts/test.sh spread
- [ ] Code formatted: go fmt ./...
- [ ] Law verification passes (if applicable)
- [ ] Rebased on main

## Commands
git-codemap rebase      # Rebase onto main
git-codemap merge       # Merge to main

## When Complete
git-codemap close